<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@6.0.0-alpha.1/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-B/GM4XqrwHnWXNOWMbloTmrYXZg10cakYGmpfsR/bbzQ6JAJI4ihuyADKLnBgrCe" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <script type="module" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@6.0.0-alpha.1/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js" integrity="sha384-1a/pXj49ZQ1aHEmrJ+gMw1otqoVsYwlEnlD8mIfY2TV03r20Y0CN7uqx1tQogjPL" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <title>Home</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav class="d-flex justify-content-between container">
        <div class="flex-start">
            <a href="/"><span class="logo">2KYR Group</a>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-end">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <a href="/Services" class="mx-4">Services</a>
            <a href="/Contacts" class="activateItem">Contactez-Nous</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <h1>Veuillez remplir le formulaire ci-dessous pour nous contacter, merci pour la Confiance!</h1>

    <section class="form container mt-5">
        
        <div class="form-group">

            <div class="mb-3 row">
                <label for="text" class="sm:col-2 col-form-label">Prénoms</label>
                <div class="sm:col-10">
                    <input type="text" readonly class="form-control" placeholder="Entrez votre Prénoms svp!">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mb-3 row">
                <label for="text" class="sm:col-2 col-form-label">Nom</label>
                <div class="sm:col-10">
                    <input type="text" readonly class="form-control" placeholder="Entrez votre Nom svp!">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mb-3 row">
                <label for="text" class="sm:col-2 col-form-label">Email</label>
                <div class="sm:col-10">
                    <input type="text"  readonly class="form-control" id="staticEmail" placeholder="Entrez votre Adresse Email svp!">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mb-3 row">
                <label for="inputPassword" class="sm:col-2 col-form-label">Password</label>
                <div class="sm:col-10">
                    <input type="password" class="form-control" id="inputPassword" placeholder="Entrez votre Mot de Passe svp!">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>    .
    </section>

     <style>

        nav{
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .flex-start a{
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: black;
        }

        .flex-end a{
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: black;
            padding: 5px;
        }

        .flex-end a:hover{
            color: rgb(84, 40, 228);
            border: 1px solid rgb(84, 40, 228);
            border-radius: 25px;
        }

        h1{
            margin-top: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-style: italic;
            font-weight: lighter;
            color: black;
        }

        .form-group{
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 10px;
            padding: 20px;
            width: 100%;
            height: 350px;
            border: 1px solid rgb(84, 40, 228);
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgb(84, 40, 228);
        }

        
    </style>
  </body>